        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-05-02T13:48:08.549Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"30783\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My thought is Rambler for the team up box, Greazer or Fashion for Space, and Young Legacy for OblivAeon</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, I honestly think there’s a chance of <em>both</em> Greazer and Fashion for Space, if we’re getting Greazer at all. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1/2.png?v=12\" title=\":+1:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:t2:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I mean, how many other space heroes are left? Lifeline, Sky-Scraper… Okay, I suppose Void Guard are possible since we’re not really going chronologically, now… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/thinking.png?v=12\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
